"uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824210_2490896254678321_78089891004512786_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9zknv8K9WvAQ7kNvwEKxM99&_nc_oc=AdqUMX2Y2WIEqnA8P9uUB-b43LLGmZCjHTDAs-qlbu5i9sW30cfE0jLnrQNqt_ZhHFU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHN2NO-KsCb1dnGKGhBTv9nLkPyjSL1xkSjE89zpcKJMg&oe=6A97363B"}, {"file_name": "image_Dutan_en_2560\u00d71440.png", "id": "2811375802548176", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618515_2811375805881509_8346001052332955169_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DJFyPPbrqqMQ7kNvwFxx-Hv&_nc_oc=AdpuGif-fMEuMLPjuwbXEAc92HzzrM1i_bivUBtdyyjFtw0KScflTC0WPiHxhWVp_mU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHit_-114gKq-kt_cB8c1Zp6i1-9Dpok6QJGvUNRefGkw&oe=6A973FC6"}, {"file_name": "image_age90_en_2560\u00d71440.png", "id": "1945941046026935", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822931_1945941049360268_7637566023011906598_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2yi31hjZUh4Q7kNvwH1h40O&_nc_oc=Adp5knNMcvX8LwSxLhCV1bC6BWk3gUh55aF1IGCUtWfI9aa66ORH1XA_IfbwbLKBRqk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH-BkUU4-tpR50b-lTfwr65NevMkq7Sv1SMOAlISNeDYg&oe=6A975325"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Iromie: Color Vision & Aging Experience", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\"What if you could see the world through someone else's eyes?\"\n\n\"Iromie: Color Vision & Aging Experience\" is a Mixed Reality (MR) tool designed to bridge the gap in visual understanding. Using advanced Passthrough technology, it simulates in real-time how your current surroundings appear to individuals with different color vision types or age-related visual changes.\n\n[Key Features]\n\nColor Vision Simulation: Experience various types of color vision, including Protanopia, Deuteranopia, and Tritanopia.\n\nAging Vision Experience: Replicate the yellowing and clouding of the visual field associated with aging.\n\nIntuitive Controls: Seamlessly cycle through filters using your VR controllers to compare visual differences instantly.\n\n[Technology Credits] The visual simulation technology in this app is provided by The University of Electro-Communications (UEC) in Tokyo (Patent Pending). It delivers a highly accurate experience based on the latest academic research.\n\n[Who is this for?]\n\nEducators & Healthcare Professionals: Enhance empathy and awareness in accessibility training.\n\nDesigners & Architects: Validate universal design choices and color accessibility.\n\nPublic Organizations: Test the visibility of signage and safety routes.\n\nUnderstanding the \"difference\" in vision is the first step towards true inclusivity. Gain a new perspective with Iromie.", "short_description": "Experience visual diversity. An MR simulator for color vision and aging via Passthrough, backed by academic research."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://coyote-runner.co.jp/iromie-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "COYOTE RUNNER INC.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://coyote-runner.co.jp/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "478089301798119"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ja"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "35685838631061648"}, "r